diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 069998f..d99d101 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fixed: a hit costing more than the limit (a bucket's capacity) was told to retry later although it could never succeed, and crashed with IndexError on a sliding window. It now raises the same ValueError as a cost below 1, whose message becomes `cost must be between 1 and {limit}: {cost}`, and spends nothing.
 - `TokenBucket` takes `refill_period` (seconds from empty to full) instead of `refill_per_second`.
 - `Decision.retry_after` (and a snapshot's `retry_after`) is now whole milliseconds, rounded up, instead of float seconds.
 
